Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: AEGIS-SIGMA <team@aegis-sigma.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libsqlite3-0, libgcc-s1, ca-certificates
Recommends: wireguard, nginx
Description: AEGIS-SIGMA Community Edition — Open-source web security firewall
 Real-time web traffic classification engine with SIMD-optimized C inference,
 LightGBM classifier, Isolation Forest anomaly detection, and Go gateway.
 .
 Features: IP blocking, challenge pages, honeypots, GeoIP enrichment,
 lead management, email tools, and 10 security agent prompts.
 .
 Community tier: C Engine, Go Shield, Go Soul, Go GeoIP, Go Trap,
 Go Bridge, Traffic Generator, 10 security agent MDs, training scripts.
 .
 Telemetry: Optional anonymized threat data collection to improve
 model accuracy across the AEGIS-SIGMA network. Disable in .env.
